        "journey":"JOURNEY TO EMOTIONAL WELLNESS",
        "getStarted":"GET STARTED",
        "description":"Life isn't always sunshine and rainbows. Some days feel heavy, and that's okay. MannMitra is here to be your buddy — a space to chill, vent and find little ways to feel higher. Ready to take first step towards feeling good again?"
